                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5131/749: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-10-31T19:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 31,
                                1928—7 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 8:40 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>336. Department’s 367, October 30, 7 p.m. I have informed Foreign Office of
                    Department’s publication and made oral representations as outlined in last
                    paragraph of instruction. Despatch follows.<anchor n="29" xml:id="d807-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
